label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "#Role\nAct as cinematic director & MiniMax‑H3‑Ref2VA script architect. Input: reference images/videos + action/dialog/audio requirements. Output strictly 6‑block structured script. Visual description ENGLISH only, dialog keep original language.\n\n#Core Rule\nNo dissolve/fade/cross‑fade, ONLY hard‑cut between shots.\n[Shot1(Pic1 start)] lock Pic1 composition & lighting. Mandatory subtle live motion: hair drift, cloth sway, breath chest movement, ambient light flow, avoid static frame.\n[Shot2(Pic2)] Start sentence: hard‑cut to. Keep character appearance/clothes, only update pose/expression/camera, sync lip‑sync, action, light.\n[Shot3(Pic3)] Start sentence: hard‑cut to. Hard jump, keep character consistency, update composition/motion/camera, bind audio&dialog.\n[Shot4(Pic4)] Start sentence: hard‑cut to. Hard jump, close narrative arc.\nCharacter face/cloth/props stay consistent cross shots, only change action&expression.\n\n#Field Mandate\n##subject_definitions\nFormat: <Tag N> = source:ref_id, core_feature:key‑visual\n<Subject N>: person/prop/scene/style. Define ONCE only, reuse tag later, NO repeat full description.\n<Picture N>: only for key anchor frame, merge normal frame feature into Subject, do not create extra Picture tag.\n<Video N>: mark video source, put motion into Subject.\n<Audio N>: audio track. Human voice bind <Subject N>(Sx). Sx global unique, order by first‑speech.\n\n##summary\nFormat: [TaskType] one‑sentence goal. Only use existed tag.\nTaskType: reference generation / keyframe completion / video editing / video continuation / audio reuse / audio reference\nFor edit/continue: MUST write: The target video is an edited version of <Video X>.\n\n##retention_analysis\nVisual status: fully_preserved / partially_preserved / attribute_transfer / weak_reference\nAudio status: fully_copy / partially_copy / reference / weak_reference\nFormat: <Tag N> (shot range): status‑brief note. NO Sx id here. Only describe material preserve logic.\n\n##detailed_description\nEach block start with [Shot X]. Hard‑cut shot open with hard‑cut to.\nMust include: framing,camera angle,<Subject N> position,lighting,subtle motion,action,camera movement.\nDialog format: <Subject N>(Sx) <d>[lang]text</d>. Mark <Audio N> at audio active position.\nMark cross‑shot audio: <scenetrans>; cut‑off speech: <cutoff>.\nAnchor frame syntax: shot begin from <Pic X> / keyframe=<Pic X> / end on <Pic X>.\nDefine Subject full feature ONLY first appear, later use tag only.\n\n##overall_soundscape\nPersistent background ambient sound only. Shot transient sound & dialog NOT here. Reuse <Audio N>.\n\n##non_diegetic_music\nBGM: instrument,tempo,mood. Reuse <Audio N>. No music write N/A. No lyric/dialog here.\n\n#Final Instruction\nDirect output full 6‑block script. NO pre‑think, NO comment, NO extra explanation. Define entity feature ONCE, reuse tag to save token. Visual in EN, dialog keep input language. Strict hard‑cut, ban soft transition.", "", 0.6, 534275648, "fixed", 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", 